<title>PHILIPPINES: Far East Bank sets offices in Asian cities.</title>
<headline>Far East Bank sets offices in Asian cities.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Far East Bank and Trust Co has been given the green light by the Monetary Board to open representative offices in Vietnam and Indonesia, the Central Bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The statement said the bank's presence in the two countries is in line with its desire to be a regional player in the Southeast Asian region.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937</p>
</text>
